  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Creating Wealth - Agriculture Value Chains Edition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To contribute to reduced poverty and inequality by accelerating women&#xbf;s economic growth in South Africa by enhancing the capacity of Women Owned Small and Medium Businesses (WSMBs) operating in winery and horticulture value chains within the formal sector and effectively positioning them to access markets and engage with government actors to effectively implement existing gender-responsive policies.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
